@startuml get-manager-dev-user
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/dev/user
caption CRB-72 · 개발용 회원 목록 (완전탈퇴 화면용, superadmin 전용). DEV_USER_DELETE_ENABLED=true인 환경(staging)에서만 열림

actor Client
participant "DevUserDeleteEnabledGuard\n+ ManagerGuard\n+ SuperAdminGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "DevUserController" as Controller
participant "DevUserService" as Service
participant "AdminDevUserRepository" as AdminDevUserRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/dev/user?page=&size=\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
alt DEV_USER_DELETE_ENABLED가 true가 아님 (기본 꺼짐)
  Guard -[#red]-> Client: 404 Cannot GET /api/manager/v1/dev/user?...
  note right
    매니저 가드보다 먼저 봐서 토큰 없이도 없는 경로와 같은 응답.
    값은 서버가 뜰 때 읽음. true · false · 빈 값 외에는 서버가 뜨지 않음
  end note
end
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard + SuperAdminGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found\n403 Superadmin privilege is required.
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt query 검증 실패 (page < 1, size < 1 또는 > 50, 정수가 아님)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
note right of Pipe: 기본값 page = 1, size = 20
Pipe -> Controller: list(query)
Controller -> Service: list(query)

par 동시에 조회
  Service -> AdminDevUserRepository: findPage(offset, limit)
  AdminDevUserRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT pk, type, status, is_deleted, withdraw_requested_at,\nname, email, created_at FROM users\nORDER BY created_at DESC, pk LIMIT OFFSET
  note right
    탈퇴 처리가 끝난(is_deleted) 유저도 행이 남아 있어 같이 보여 줌.
    방금 가입한 테스트 계정을 찾기 쉽게 최근 가입 순.
    연락처(coffee_chat_contact, 공유된 연락처)는 내려주지 않음
  end note
  AdminDevUserRepository --> Service: rows
else
  Service -> AdminDevUserRepository: (count)
  AdminDevUserRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT count(*) FROM users
  AdminDevUserRepository --> Service: total
end

Service -> Service: status 계산\nis_deleted → "withdrawn"\nwithdraw_requested_at 있음 → "withdrawal_requested"\n그 외 → users.status (pending | active)
Service --> Controller: { items, page, size, total }
Controller --> Client: 200 { items: DevUserDto[], page, size, total }\nitem = { user_pk, type, status, name, email, created_at }

@enduml
